# k.actions/shards/verbs-deselect: 6 verbs and phrasal verbs that mean the act "deselect" (deselect, unselect, unmark, unhighlight, untick, uncheck ...): the WordNet senses read for it, the role of the object, what the verb itself says, and the prepositions that mark a role after this verb.
